  "id": "behind-the-scenes-s01e09-scene-18",
  "pair": "zh-en",
  "title": "正常人的社交规则  (Normal Rules for Asking Someone Out)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "chun_yuqiao": "淳于乔",
    "kaiwen": "凯文",
    "xingzi": "杏子"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Just as Kaiwen reaches the door, Chun Yuqiao awkwardly calls him back to ask a hypothetical question about being invited out for tea. Listen to their Mandarin conversation.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "你先回来，我突然想起来个事，得问一下你。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "如果有个女孩要约你出去喝茶，你会怎么办？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "你不说我也能猜着，肯定是辛惠美吧？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "你甭管是谁，你就说你会怎么办。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "对付这种事你不是挺有一套吗？像上次对秦箫那样就行。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "不是，这次不能这样，这次不一样。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "女孩要是主动约你的话，不管你心里怎么想，都得先答应。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "这是正常人的社交规则，这方面你就不太正常。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "你肯定是把人家拒绝了对吧？赶快再约人家一次，弥补一下。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "要是把人心伤了，以后可就难办了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "十有八九你猜准了，我有确切证据！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "真的有证据吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "我胡说八道几句就把他诈出来了，他明显心里头乱了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "咱们的春天估计要来了！",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "你先回来，我突然想起来个事，得问一下你。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Come back first; I suddenly remembered something I need to ask you.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "如果有个女孩要约你出去喝茶，你会怎么办？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'If a girl wanted to ask you out for tea, what would you do?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "你不说我也能猜着，肯定是辛惠美吧？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Even if you do not say who, I can guess—it must be Xin Huimei, right?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "你甭管是谁，你就说你会怎么办。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Never mind who it is; just tell me what you would do.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "对付这种事你不是挺有一套吗？像上次对秦箫那样就行。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Do you not already have a whole routine for handling that, just like you did with Qin Xiao last time?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "不是，这次不能这样，这次不一样。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'No, I cannot handle it like that this time; this time is different.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "女孩要是主动约你的话，不管你心里怎么想，都得先答应。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'When a girl takes the initiative to ask you out, whatever you feel inside, you should say yes first.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "这是正常人的社交规则，这方面你就不太正常。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Those are normal social rules, and in this area you are not very normal.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "你肯定是把人家拒绝了对吧？赶快再约人家一次，弥补一下。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'You definitely turned her down, right? Hurry up and ask her out again to make up for it.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "要是把人心伤了，以后可就难办了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Once you hurt someone's heart, things get mighty hard to fix later on.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "十有八九你猜准了，我有确切证据！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Nine times out of ten your hunch was spot on—I have solid proof!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "真的有证据吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Do you really have proof?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "我胡说八道几句就把他诈出来了，他明显心里头乱了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'A bit of bluffing tricked it right out of him; his mind is clearly all tangled up.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "咱们的春天估计要来了！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'It looks like springtime is finally coming for us!'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "你先回来，我突然想起来个事，得问一下你。",
